cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these protocols, please cite them as below."
title: "APPN Field Standard Operating Procedures and Pipelines"
abstract: >-
  Standard operating procedures (SOPs) and processing pipelines for aerial
  and ground field phenotyping across the Australian Plant Phenomics Network
  (APPN), covering flight design, sensor field books, QA, plot delineation,
  data management and processing pipelines.
version: "1.03"
date-released: 2026-10-19
license: CC-BY-4.0
